	(text "RS-485: fit TERM only at the two physical bus ends;\n        fit BIAS A + BIAS B on one node only (normally the master).\nRS-232: REMOVE TERM, BIAS A and BIAS B (they would load TXD).\nD2 SM712: -7 / +12 V TVS for the bus pins.\nD3: 15 V bidirectional TVS for the RS-232 receiver input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 238.76 162.56 0)
